# Published project content — src/devlog/, src/projects/, src/images/devlog/,
# and demo dirs src/<slug>/ — is COMMITTED source, pushed per-project by
# scripts/devpublish.sh (see docs/PIPELINE.md). Intentionally NOT ignored.

# scripts/sync-projects.sh is an optional one-time importer (not part of the
# build); its only throwaway output is the unused project rollup:
src/_data/syncedProjects.json
